{"name":"Notice Me","hex":"#ba8686","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"notice","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The act of observing; perception.","A written or printed announcement."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To remark upon; to mention. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","To become aware of; to observe."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/notice"}],"entries":[{"title":"Notice Me (Migos song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Notice Me\" is a song by the American hip-hop group Migos featuring American rapper Post Malone. It was released on January 26, 2018, as a track from the former's second studio album Culture II. The song was produced by FKi 1st."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notice_Me_(Migos_song)","wikidata":"Q111936884"},{"title":"Notice Me (Sandée song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Notice Me\" is the first single from freestyle singer Sandeé's debut album Only Time Will Tell."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c8/Sande%C3%A9_-_Notice_Me.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notice_Me_(Sand%C3%A9e_song)","wikidata":"Q7063004"},{"title":"Notice","blocks":[{"text":"Notice is the legal concept describing a requirement that a party be aware of legal process affecting their rights, obligations or duties. There are several types of notice: public notice, actual notice, constructive notice."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/List_of_causes_set_down_for_trial_in_the_Circuit_Court_of_Mercer_County%2C_at_September_term%2C_1807.png/330px-List_of_causes_set_down_for_trial_in_the_Circuit_Court_of_Mercer_County%2C_at_September_term%2C_1807.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Notice","wikidata":"Q7063001"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"notice":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedi